sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as user-web
  participant C as NoticePortalController
  participant S as NoticeService / ProjectService
  participant M as Mapper
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant V as NoticeViewAssembler

  U->>C: GET /notice/page
  C->>S: getNoticePage(reqVO)
  S->>M: selectPage(reqVO)
  M->>DB: 查询 notice（筛选 + 分页）
  DB-->>M: PageResult<NoticePortalDO>
  S->>V: buildNoticeList(notices, false)
  V->>DB: 批量查询 project / tender_project / tender_lot
  V->>DB: 批量查询 enterprise / base_area / base_code
  DB-->>V: 关联数据
  V-->>S: List<NoticeRespVO>
  S-->>C: PageResult<NoticeRespVO>
  C-->>U: CommonResult<PageResult>

  U->>C: GET /notice/detail?id=
  C->>S: getNoticeDetail(id)
  S->>DB: 查询 notice
  S->>V: buildNoticeList(notices, true)
  V->>DB: 查询附件 / 澄清 / 企业关联
  V-->>S: NoticeRespVO
  S-->>C: NoticeRespVO
  C-->>U: CommonResult<NoticeRespVO>
